> > > >
> > > > https://author-tools.ietf.org/iddiff?url1=3Ddraft-ietf-tls-mlkem-0=
5&url2=3Ddraft-ietf-tls-mlkem-07&difftype=3D--html
> > > >
> > > > The main focus of this WGLC is to review new text providing more c=
ontext around the use of pure ML-KEM. For those who indicated they wanted =
this text, please let us know if the new text satisfies you and if you sup=
port publication. This working group last call will end on February 27, 20=
26.
> > > >
